<description>&lt;p&gt;Chinese coast guard and navy vessels are threatening to cut undersea cables linking Taiwan and the Philippines and are intensifying patrols near Taiwan, while a Chinese vessel carrying unidentified equipment was probed inside Scarborough Shoal. The Philippine Coast Guard rescued a ferry in Quezon waters, delivered fuel to fishermen at Scarborough Shoal, and assisted over 150,000 sea travelers during Undas, while also formalizing a partnership with the University of the Philippines. Philippine officials criticised China’s inconsistent stance on UNCLOS and warned of possible undersea cable targeting near Japan. 176 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxQVTQzT3kxVmMtak9FMGI2bmhlVnFuUkpqUnZtWVE1SFRnaG93UVlOU3ZWQklTRDlqcTFJYTZOQXB1UnkxRHVOSDctN1ZJLTFxVElQeGtFaTRGcXJMZTQ1RGVIM2lXWWNxa3EzWTRNWS1FRWhjZ25BNUY3WnVmeFE3TEFLbi1OZzNQVEhOUFVPaDZ6ZlVaYV81NGVpUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nikkei Asia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxOVGZDb1dIakxFSktEckVjQWtBemFfenc3QUVnX3RiZHlZV2N0eUhaUmZsd0tPeUNMeGlNTVUtMjNVMTBHSXB3ZVVOZXBRZmZkX055QnJEekhCcjR5VU9oazdvT2M2TXV2NXlnb1U4U1JhbFA2c3RkWHV4N2tWakRxNk9aQ0xFR2pZRmNCVXJhYWpjUmFiQl83Nnprb1Vad0pTZi1EU1dscmM4UUJxN2c?oc=5&quot;&gt;Shipping Telegraph&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Inquirer.net&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Defense Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxNSWt0ckRGSTRCTGpjZHVRYW9KSlVJSFVDSWVibFJqcjlwMWJDRnRjeTg5NXZhQkJETVlfZ1pJMFZ4dXdMY01OUC1TWGI5RHNPWVFDU29TUEowaHRkeUJfWFVMZTA2ZlFlREpDOTR1c2VhRFhuU3NJLXREVE5xZkZQYjZHS1BiOUZiSlB0TE9QWEh4M000MXJ5dmxoOGg1Zm9j?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?